[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key\nis in the OFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal\n(-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"],[7,63,0,"<p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3024839\">1056B78</a> .</p>"],[24,63,0,"<p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025049\">1060G42</a> .</p>"],[24,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the clip (1a) and release the rod (1b) for the clutch\nmaster cylinder from the pedal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004196.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[24,63,0,"<p>1. Remove the stop clip (1a), withdraw the pin (1b) and remove the\nclutch pedal (1c).</p><p>2. Keep the bushes.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004197.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the clutch pedal, complete\nwith bushes, back in its housing and secure it to the brake pedal\nusing the pin and the stop clip.</p><p>Connect the rod for the clutch master cylinder\nto the pedal and secure it using the clip.</p>"],[24,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025049\">1060G42</a> .</p>"],[7,63,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3024839\">1056B78</a> .</p>"],[7,63,0,"<p>Connect the negative (-) battery\nterminal.</p>"]]